	measure 'Ventas YoY%' = ```
			
			        DIVIDE(
			            [Ventas Totales] - [Ventas YoY],
			            [Ventas YoY]
			        )
			```
		displayFolder: Ventas
		lineageTag: 6dfb5937-b80c-4baa-8ac1-f89ff349d43b

